# Viewer of the preset check `preset_players`: the first tested preset, engine + players + orbit_camera
# + menu, seen by a client that renders (natively with --software-renderer, or the browser build).
#   node scripts/verify/network/run.mjs --scenario preset_players [--browser]
# It turns the camera with the orbit module (rebound to Q/E, because the players module and the
# orbit module both default to the arrow keys), opens the pause menu and writes PNGs. The other
# client (client_a.cmds, no renderer) holds ArrowUp (forward, -z) for 16 ticks (a longer hold slides the cube off the ground: players module tuning); run.mjs asserts that exactly that player moved
# and that every process agrees on every body.
# Why two clients: a rendering client on a software renderer ticks slower than 64 Hz and its snapshots
# pause the fixed clock, so its own held-key inputs reach the server at the wrong ticks and its
# prediction cannot converge (see CLAUDE.md, Networking, clocks). A viewer sends no inputs, so it cannot suffer.
# Expected pictures (target/snapshots/ natively, target/snapshots/web/ in the browser):
#   preset_start.png:  the sandbox scene and toolbar, seen before this client joined.
#   preset_moved.png:  the blue sandbox cube and two red player cubes: the viewer's own (idle at its spawn point) and the other
#                      player's (moved forward, away from the camera, at rest); the view turned by the orbit
#                      camera (key E held for 0.5 s).
#   preset_menu.png:   the same scene with the centered "Paused" menu (Resume, Reset boxes, Quit).
input.unbind orbit_left ArrowLeft
input.unbind orbit_right ArrowRight
input.bind orbit_left Q
input.bind orbit_right E
orbit.start sandbox_camera 8 4
snapshot preset_start
wait_until 3000 assert.net_joined
input.key_down E
wait 32
input.key_up E
# Time for the other client to move its player and for the cube to come to rest.
wait 1000
net.bodies
net.stats
assert.net_bytes_below sent 20000
assert.net_bytes_below received 100000
snapshot preset_moved
input.tap Escape
wait 2
snapshot preset_menu
# Stay connected until the server has printed (see server.cmds).
wait 1400
quit
